%% TECH-010 Flaky picture thumbnail in MUPP-010-R4
%% How a flake is handled: looked for under load, fixed only when its cause is known.
flowchart TD
    A[A test failed now and then] --> B[Run it 20 times under load, on the current code and the code where it failed]
    B --> C{Reproduced? R1}
    C -- yes --> D[The trace shows the late step]
    D --> E{Does the site behave correctly?}
    E -- yes --> F[Longer timeout on that one expect, with a comment R2]
    E -- no --> G[Fix the site R2]
    C -- no --> H[Change nothing; record the runs R2]
    F --> I[Four spec files, 20 times, under load, three runs in a row R3]
    G --> I
    H --> I
